   "ThinkingCap-Qwen3.8-27B Heretic (NInfer) \u00b7 ~31 GB (ninfer sizes its KV pool to the card) \u2014 Dragoy revised-Heretic ThinkingCap-Qwen3.8-27B NVFP4 on ninfer-serve (DFlash2 K7, MTP head, vision built in); best rewrites in the 2026-09-27 bake-off, ~2x llama speed",
