   "Qwen3.8-27B Q2_K_XL \u00b7 9.2 GB download \u00b7 ~13 GB with the guide in context \u2014 the 27B's prose on a 16 GB card; unsloth's dynamic 2-bit, rougher than the Q4 but still the biggest writer this side of it",
